WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.015
Video 2. Windows par Hisaab install karo, ane
pehli vaar chalu karo.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:13.616
Tamne Windows 10 ke 11, 64-bit vaalu PC, ane
aashre 400 MB khaali jagya joie.

00:00:13.816 --> 00:00:20.408
Install ma paanch step chhe: download, keep,
run, setup, ane pehli sharuaat.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:27.537
Hisaab releases page kholo. Assets niche,
Hisaab_…_x64-setup.exe file shodho.

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:32.993
Ena par click karo. Biji files updates ane
Microsoft Store maate chhe.

00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:41.176
Browser puchhi shake chhe: "Make sure you trust". File
navi chhe, etle e haju olakhaati nathi.

00:00:41.206 --> 00:00:46.754
Delete ni baaju na arrow par click karo,
pachhi Keep anyway. Pachhi file kholo.

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:53.982
Have Windows ek vaadli box batavi shake chhe:
"Windows protected your PC".

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.830
More info par click karo.

00:00:56.192 --> 00:01:04.579
App line ma Hisaab setup file dekhay chhe. File par haju
paid signature nathi, etle aa box aave chhe.

00:01:04.609 --> 00:01:09.198
Run anyway par click karo. Aa fakt ek vaar
karvanu chhe.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:16.896
Hisaab setup khule chhe. E fakt tamara maate
install thay chhe, admin password vagar.

00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:22.374
Next par click karo, pachhi fari Next.
Chhelle, Hisaab chalu thay chhe.

00:01:23.454 --> 00:01:28.919
Pehli vaar khultaa ek minute laagi shake chhe:
Windows navo program check kare chhe.

00:01:28.949 --> 00:01:35.614
Pachhi Hisaab puchhe chhe ke chopda kya rakhva. Navi
sharuaat maate, khaali data folder lo.

00:01:35.644 --> 00:01:38.544
Pehla jovu hoy, to demo company kholo.

00:01:40.094 --> 00:01:47.845
Tamara chopda aa PC ma, Documents\Hisaab\Data
ma rahe chhe. Darek company nu alag folder.

00:01:47.775 --> 00:01:54.049
Pehla divas thi, Hisaab darek company no roj
backup le chhe, Documents\Hisaab\backups ma.

00:01:54.249 --> 00:02:01.787
Updates jaate aave chhe. Darek sharuaat ma, Hisaab navu
version check kare chhe, ane tamne kahe chhe.

00:02:01.717 --> 00:02:10.259
F1 › Upgrade dabavo. Hisaab pehla darek company no backup le
chhe, pachhi update karine fari chalu thay chhe.

00:02:10.559 --> 00:02:13.332
Upgrade, F1 Help menu ma chhe.

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:18.796
Update pachhi, Gateway e backup batave chhe je
Hisaab e pehla lidho.

00:02:19.276 --> 00:02:24.889
Hisaab taiyaar chhe. Have, tamari company
Tally maathi ek step ma laavo.

